  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 303.04 Operation, Maintenance, and Response Form.\n\n(a) The owner of a low hazard, significant hazard, or high hazard dam shall complete and submit the \"Operation, Maintenance and Response Form\" (OMRF) NHDES-W-02-010, May 2024, available at https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?formtag=NHDES-W-02-010.\n\n(b) The owner shall review and update the OMRF as necessary, but no less frequently than after each periodic inspection conducted by the department, and shall submit either an updated form or a statement to the department within 15 days of completing the review, indicating that the current form remains accurate.\n\n(c) The owner shall operate and maintain the dam in accordance with the submitted OMRF and in the best interest of public safety.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; amd by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
